+**Statistical conclusion validity: few, dependent comparisons.** Twelve caption sets give 66 pairs, of which the 30 within-family pairs carry H2a and H2d (Supplementary S11.4); the second-backbone runs are two prompts at three temperatures, so about 9 of its 15 pairs are short-against-detailed and 6 are near-copies, and the effective number of independent comparisons is far below 30. Pairs share images and systems, so the exact lower limit printed with H2a is descriptive, and H2d has low power. A certificate holds for the fixed captions on these images; it says nothing about a re-run of a system or another image set.
